printing.caption_limit = Insiguro y'ifoto ni ndende cane kuri uru rusobe. Koresha imirongo canke inkingi nke, uyigabanye canke uzimye insiguro.
printing.font_error = Nta nyuguti zo kwandika zihari ku nsiguro y'ifoto. Shiramwo imyandikire y'inyandiko canke uzimye insiguro.
printing.no_document = Ugurura inyandiko canke uhitemwo amafoto mu bubiko bw'amafoto imbere yo gucapura.
printing.source_error = Ifoto yatowe, idosiye iyiherekeza yahinduwe canke insiguro y'ifoto ntivyashoboye gusomwa. Nta PDF yabitswe.
printing.save_error = PDF ntiyashoboye kubikwa. Hitamwo izina rishasha ry'idosiye mu bubiko bwemerera kwandika; amadosiye asanzweho ntasubirizwa na rimwe.
